msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"There's a gelato place over on Taihei Boulevard called Gelateria Kamuro. "
"Apparently it's pretty popular, even among businessmen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Oh, that place? Yeah, they do have some good gelato, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Ah, so you've been."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Yeah. And now that ya mention it, you're right! I went there one day after "
"work, and the place was crawlin' with exhausted old dudes in suits!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "So. You're a gelato man, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Well, I wouldn't say I'm crazy about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Huh. Hard to imagine ya liftin' a tiny little spoonful of spumoni into that "
"jaw of yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Yeah...?"
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"There's this famous actor, Noboru Kudarizaka, who shows up at Sushi Gin "
"sometimes. But he always goes incognito."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Oooh, that must mean he's hiding something from the public! I wonder what "
"kinda floozy he brought there with him. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Hmm... I never heard anything like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Well! That's rather enlightening. Maybe I'll go to Sushi Gin next time and "
"take a little peek for myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Ever heard of Kanrai? It's a barbecue place over on Shichifuku Street that "
"uses authentic Korean kimchi. It's apparently good for you, due to the... "
"what was it again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Oh, I know! Kimchi has capsaicin, right? Helps ya clear your sinuses, at "
"least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Giusto..."

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"But yeah, I'm a huge fan of Kanrai and their kimchi! ♪ And, spicy food in "
"general. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Have you heard of Kyushu No. 1 Star on Pink Street? Apparently their ramen's"
" full of collagen... Ladies like that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "We do... But I never really heard of that place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Oh. Well, the previous owner came back, and they started\r\n"
"making their tonkotsu the way they do it in Kyushu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"He said the extra collagen comes from slow-simmering the pork bone. That's "
"why their chashu's so tender, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Is that a fact? Huh... Maybe I'll try it sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "You know about the Yoshida Batting Center on Shichifuku Street?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Oh, the batting cages? Yeah, why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Well, did you know professional baseball players sometimes go there for "
"practice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Hunh. Alright then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "That's all...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "What? I don't care much for baseball. Sorry if that offends ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"You heard about the Matcha Fair that Café Alps is having?\r\n"
"It's that little place over on Nakamichi Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, the one with the Japanese desserts, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "That's the one."
msgstr "Proprio lui."

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Hm. Honestly, I kinda like coconut and tropical stuff more.\r\n"
"Ooh, and don't even get me started on boba! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Have you eaten the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "What the heck? No, but that sounds delicious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "Apparently it got popular because some idol blogged about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Hmm... Braised pork does sound good in a burger..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "I'll have one of our ladies buy it for me sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"There's a place called Le Marche over on Showa Street where you can order "
"any kind of bag you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Really!? Anything!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"I think so. Every two months, the owner heads over to Europe, so if you can "
"catch him before then, he should be able to get you what you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"Wow, that's some hot info right there. Never knew the owner literally went "
"the distance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"I'd better hurry up on makin' that order. There're some shoes I missed out "
"on last year..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"They're practically sold out all over Japan, so... I'd love him forever if "
"he could get 'em! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Do you know about Tantakatan? It's a shochu made from perilla leaves..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"Shochu, huh? Well, I can't drink worth a damn... Haven't I said this before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"Oh, but don't let that stop ya. I'd love to learn more about somethin' I'll "
"never be able to enjoy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Oh, all right..."
msgstr "Oh, va bene..."

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"If you're ever in Okinawa, try out the soba shop at the Kariyushi Arcade. "
"They make it the traditional way, and their rafute's some of the best on the"
" island."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Rafute? As in that sweet braised pork stuff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"Actually, I've seen that on TV before. The rafute loses its excess fat while"
" cookin', so the soup is chock-full of nutrients like collagen. Keeps your "
"skin smooth and all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "Oh, I'm surprised you knew."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Hehehe... I got some pretty juicy info of my own, now, don't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of a bar called Aqua Sky? It's all the way in Okinawa, "
"over at Hatsumachi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Hmm... Nope, this'd be the first time I've heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"Apparently, they serve you a little something that pairs well with alcohol. "
"Can you guess what that might be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "Uh... Since it's Okinawa, would it be... that special tofu they have?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Close. It's actually salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Salt? Ya mean, like, regular old salt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"No, not just any old salt, but an especially rare one made only in Okinawa. "
"Not only is it salty, but it also has a sweetness to it... Helps bring out "
"the flavor of your drink."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"Huh... Drinkin' with a side of salt... I guess I could see it workin'. That "
"is sorta adult-ish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "You should try it out sometime. I think you'd like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "So, about Gelateria Kamuro..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"The one that's popular with businessmen? Second time you're talkin' about "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "Oh. Really?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "Yep. You must really love gelato, Kiryu-san. Manly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "Have you tried out Sushi Gin yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Yeah, it was a real letdown... Noboru Kudarizaka never showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "Sorry to hear that."
msgstr "Mi dispiace..."

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"Grr... Well, whatever. I'm just gonna hafta keep going till I meet him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "About that kimchi at Kanrai..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah. When I went there with some of the gals here, the\r\n"
"manager gave us some kimchi on the house. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "That's wonderful."
msgstr "È meraviglioso!"

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"And when I told him I loved spicy things, he gave me some with extra peppers"
" in it. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "Heh... As if you needed any more spice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"I did, and it was so good! Nice goin', Kyushu! You made somethin' worthy of "
"excellence! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "I'm glad you enjoyed yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid ""
"And how! I'll definitely be back for more of their tonkotsu. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Have you been to the Yoshida Batting Center by any chance?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Nope, haven't gone. And I don't do baseball to begin with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "It ain't my kinda sport... Didn't I say that before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "That's right, you did..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "Come on... Listen to me for once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Have you been to the Matcha Fair over at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Oh... No, I haven't. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "That's okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "Did you end up trying the braised pork burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "Sure did. And ya know what? It was actually not bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid ""
"But... I think they could've at least made it into a patty. What they did "
"was just take the recipe for regular braised pork and dump it onto a bun. "
"That's just lazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "...Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Did you get to reserve anything at Le Marche?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid "Nope. Turns out they don't visit the place that makes my shoes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"Knowing how cute and limited-edition they are, not being able to get 'em is "
"the crappiest feeling on earth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "I see... That's too bad."
msgstr "Capisco... Che peccato."

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"You're tellin' me! I was more let down than I've ever been, and it's all "
"your fault! You better take responsibility and find me some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid "Hey... I never said it was satisfaction guaranteed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "So about Tantakatan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "Sorry, I don't drink. So I wouldn't know anything about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid "That's right..."
msgstr "Esatto..."

msgctxt "1576"
msgid ""
"However... Tantakatan is pretty popular at the club. And apparently it's "
"good when ya mix it with cranberry juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid ""
"The gals here say they like it, so I'm sure it's real tasty. If you're a "
"drinker, anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid "So. Let's talk rafute soba..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1612"
msgid ""
"Right! After ya brought it up, I decided I just had to have some, so I went "
"to the Okinawan restaurant near my house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1624"
msgid ""
"And wouldn't ya know it⑬it was delicious! Sure wish I could head over to "
"Okinawa right now and get the full experience... Hey, maybe I should take a "
"vacation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1636"
msgid "Have I mentioned there's a really popular snack⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1648"
msgid "Yep. It's some kinda Okinawan salt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1660"
msgid ""
"I looked, and it turns out ya can't get it over here. Buy some for me next "
"time you're on vacation, will ya?"
msgstr ""

